    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "No. 76 Glasmore Park is a three bedroom end of terrace family home ideally situated in a mature location offering excellent potential. The accommodation extends to 78 sq.m. and includes; entrance porch, entrance hall, living room, kitchen and separate dining room completes the ground floor. Upstairs there are three bedrooms and main bathroom. The attached block built shed extends to 15 sq.m. providing additional storage with potential for use as; workshop/utility/home office. To the front there is a private garden with off street parking. The private rear garden is an impressive size. Although dated, the property has been lovingly maintained in immaculate condition throughout. Glasmore Park is well located and easily accessible from both the Brackenstown and Rathbeale Roads. All amenities including Swords Main Street, buses, shops, schools, playgrounds and parks are within easy walking distance. Viewing is highly recommended to appreciate the condition and potential of this pristine and well located family home.\r\n\r\n* Mature, established and convenient location\r\n* Large rear garden and side entrance offers excellent potential\r\n* Lovingly maintained in immaculate condition throughout\r\n* Gas fired central heating\r\n* Fully tiled bathroom\r\n* PVC double glazed windows and doors\r\n* Walking distance to all local amenities including a host of schools, shops, church, playgrounds, the Ward River Valley Park and Swords Main Street\r\n* Bus routes on your doorstep include: \r\nSwords Express – Express service to Dublin City Centre, Dublin Bus Routes 41 and 41C\r\n* Primary Schools close by: \r\nSt. Cronan’s Junior National School, Swords Educate Together National School, Thornleigh Educate Together National School, Gaelscoil Brian Boroimhe, Broadmeadow CNS\r\n* Secondary Schools close by: \r\nSwords Community College, St Finian’s Community College, Fingal Community College, Loreto College, Colaiste Choilm"
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Accommodation",
        "SortOrder": 1,
        "Content": "GROUND FLOOR:\r\n\r\nEntrance porch - Double glazed doors.Tiled floor.\r\n\r\nEntrance Hall - Stairs to first floor. Carpet to hall, stairs and landing.\r\n\r\nLiving room - 3.9m x 3.7m\r\nFeature fireplace with open fire and electric fire insert. Carpet fitted.\r\n\r\nKitchen - 2.8m x 2.3m\r\nFitted kitchen with tiled floor. PVC door to rear garden.\r\n\r\nDining room - 2.8m x 3.2m\r\nTiled floor. Built in storage and worktop. Hotpress.\r\n\r\nFIRST FLOOR:\r\n\r\nLanding - Access hatch to attic.\r\n\r\nBedroom 1 - 3.9m x 3.2m (front right)\r\nDouble room. Carpet fitted.\r\n\r\nBedroom 2 - 2.8m x 3.5m (back right)\r\nDouble room. Carpet fitted.\r\n\r\nBedroom 3 - 3.0m x 2.3m (front left)\r\nSingle room. Carpet fitted.\r\n\r\nBathroom - 1.5m x 2.1m\r\nFully tiled. Bath with electric shower and shower door fitted, sink with storage and toilet.\r\n\r\nOUTSIDE:\r\nTo the front there is a gated garden with lawn and concrete driveway. Wide side entrance includes attached block built storage shed - 6.0m x 2.6m with electricity connected. Door to front and rear. The large, private rear garden is lawned."
      },
